### 상품 저장 @env=local
POST localhost:8080/v1/carts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity" : 10
}

### 이벤트 상품 저장
POST localhost:8080/v1/carts/event
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId" : 1,
  "quantity" : 1
}

### 장바구니 조회 @env=local
GET localhost:8080/v1/carts

### 상품 개별 삭제 @env=local
DELETE localhost:8080/v1/carts/products/{{productId}}

### 장바구니 전체 비우기 @env=local
PUT localhost:8080/v1/carts